    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Time</strong> - a world where time no longer matters. This low-polygon action game immerses players in a post-apocalyptic landscape where every move changes the course of events. Fight and gather resources to survive in this madness.<br>The game is an adventure where each level becomes unique due to randomly generated spawn weapons on level. An important feature is the time system - it moves only when the player moves, which allows you to plan your actions and make strategic decisions in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of Broken Time:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Engage in battles with enemies at a unique pace where every second can be decisive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Hunting</strong>: Collect items and weapons to fight against foes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Time Mechanics</strong>: Use your movements for dodging and maneuvering, altering the flow of battle in your favor, as time only moves when you do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor:</strong> create, save, share with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Items</strong>: every level is a new experience, with random items scattered throughout, making each playthrough unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Shatter Effects</strong>: Defeat enemies and watch them break into shards upon death, adding a dynamic visual effect to combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music</strong>: Immerse yourself in the game with a captivating musical score that enhances the overall experience and sets the tone for your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Time</strong>\u00a0it's a challenge for those ready to defy time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Time</strong> - a world where time no longer matters. This low-polygon action game immerses players in a post-apocalyptic landscape where every move changes the course of events. Fight and gather resources to survive in this madness.<br>The game is an adventure where each level becomes unique due to randomly generated spawn weapons on level. An important feature is the time system - it moves only when the player moves, which allows you to plan your actions and make strategic decisions in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of Broken Time:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Engage in battles with enemies at a unique pace where every second can be decisive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Hunting</strong>: Collect items and weapons to fight against foes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Time Mechanics</strong>: Use your movements for dodging and maneuvering, altering the flow of battle in your favor, as time only moves when you do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor:</strong> create, save, share with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Items</strong>: every level is a new experience, with random items scattered throughout, making each playthrough unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Shatter Effects</strong>: Defeat enemies and watch them break into shards upon death, adding a dynamic visual effect to combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music</strong>: Immerse yourself in the game with a captivating musical score that enhances the overall experience and sets the tone for your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Time</strong>\u00a0it's a challenge for those ready to defy time.</p>",
