        "notes": "Broken Time - includes elements of violence and brutal combat mechanics. Players use various weapons, including piercing and cutting tools, to fight enemies, which disintegrate into fragments upon death. These scenes are accompanied by bloody visual effects and intense destruction animations, which may be inappropriate for more sensitive players.\r\n\r\nThe weapons in the game have varying degrees of destructive power, making each fight unique and dangerous. There are also firearms and piercing weapons such as machetes. Enemies are inflicted with serious damage, including bloody effects and shattering into fragments, which creates vivid and visually impressive scenes."
